# .env intentionally NOT ignored — Lovable's deployed build reads env vars
# from .env in the repo, not from Lovable's project-settings env config.
# The values here are all public-by-design (Supabase anon key, gated by RLS;
# PostHog project key, shipped to every browser). The service_role key never
# lives in this file — it stays only in GitHub Actions secrets.
